* @title Gimpel general purpose macro processor
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, Chapter 18.8; Catspaw SNOBOL4+ program diskette
* @expect >>>
* xSTRINGy
* (X+Y)*(X+Y)
* STRINGY*STRINGY
* AA#AA
* AB<C>DE
* STRING
* Initialization Action
* Action
* <<<
-INCLUDE "GPM.INC"
	OUTPUT = GPM('#DEF,M,STRING;x#M;y')
	OUTPUT = GPM('#DEF,SQUARE,&1*&1;#SQUARE,(X+Y);')
	OUTPUT = GPM('#SQUARE,#M;Y;')
	OUTPUT = GPM('AA<#>AA')
	OUTPUT = GPM('A<B<C>D>E')
	OUTPUT = GPM('#DEF,A,<#M;>;#A;')
	OUTPUT = GPM('#DEF,X,Initialization <#DEF,X,Action;#X;>;#X;')
	OUTPUT = GPM('#X;')
END
